识别模式和关系，并理解你的数据。
From there, we'll get into exploratory data analysis where you will learn how to investigate a data set,
identify patterns and relationships, and understand your data before building a model.

14
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:27,040
然后是机器学习，你将学习如何训练模型从数据中学习。
Then comes machine learning, where you will learn how models can be trained to learn from data.

15
