3984
04:45:33,824 --> 04:45:42,544
估计值减去平均值与实际值减去平均值的线条越接近，R square 就越好。
The closer the lines of estimated and minus mean or actual minus mean are, the better the R square.

3985
04:45:42,704 --> 04:45:56,516
也就是说，当实际值减去平均值与估计值减去平均值之间的
距离尽可能小时，数值会更接近，因此 R square 就越大。
Meaning when all the distance between the actual minus mean and estimated mean is as less as possible, the numbers will be more,
will be closer to each other, and the hence the R square will be bigger.

3986
04:45:56,704 --> 04:45:57,860
你们理解这个概念了吗？
You got the concept.

3987
04:45:58,544 --> 04:46:10,756
如果实际值减去平均值与估计值减去平均值之间的距离越接近，数值就越接近，
而且 R square 将等于或接近 1。
If the distance between the actual minus mean and the estimated minus mean is as closer to each other,
the numbers will be as closer to each other, but and the r square will be equal to or closer to one.

3988
04:46:11,024 --> 04:46:13,828
这将代表模型拟合良好。
And that will represent a good fit in the model.

3989
