8171
09:21:02,510 --> 09:21:06,544
我们检查了它们之间是否存在良好的线性关系。
We checked out if they're having a good linear relationship in between them or not.

8172
09:21:06,704 --> 09:21:12,864
我们也可以之前创建一个散点图来检查是否存在任何线性关系。
We can also create a scatter plot earlier as well to check out if there is any linear relationship or not.

8173
