Moving on to the 23rd question: what is a lazy learning algorithm?

8775
10:08:06,158 --> 10:08:14,724
现在，懒惰学习基本上是指那些推迟从训练数据中进行泛化的算法，
直到它们收到一个新的数据点查询为止。
Now, Lazy learning basically refers to algorithms that postpone generalizing
from the training data until they receive a query that is a new data point.

8776
10:08:15,598 --> 10:08:20,068
它们在训练期间不处理数据，而是把数据存起来供以后使用。
Now they don't process the data during training but instead they store it for you later use.

8777
10:08:20,558 --> 10:08:20,976
明白了吗？
Alright?

8778
10:08:21,326 --> 10:08:24,644
所以基本上它们推迟了数据的泛化，直到收到查询请求。
So basically they delay generalization data until a query is made.

8779
10:08:25,134 --> 10:08:25,604
好的。
Alright.

8780
10:08:26,062 --> 10:08:34,788
所以在训练阶段，懒惰学习的训练几乎是瞬间完成的，
因为算法只是存储数据集，而不需要构建复杂的模型。
So in the training phase, a lazy learning training is almost instant because
the algorithm is going to store the data set without building a complex model.

8781
10:08:35,054 --> 10:08:41,796
而在预测阶段，当新的查询进来时，算法会将其与存储的数据进行比较，从而做出预测。
Whereas in the prediction phase, when a new query comes in, the
algorithm is going to compare it to the stored data to make a prediction.

8782
10:08:42,222 --> 10:08:47,008
这一步需要花点时间，因为它涉及到查阅所有存储的数据。
This step is going to take time because this is going to involve looking through all the stored data.

8783
10:08:47,054 --> 10:08:47,840
好的。
all right.

