8831
10:12:03,214 --> 10:12:12,484
CLT 或中心极限定理基本上是指，随着样本量的增加，样本均值的抽样分布趋近于正态分布。
CLT or central limit theorem basically states that the sampling distribution of
the sample mean approaches a normal distribution as the sample size increases.

8832
10:12:13,134 --> 10:12:13,552
好的。
Alright.

8833
10:12:13,742 --> 10:12:21,220
正如你在这里看到的，随着我们增加样本量，数据的分布会趋近于更标准的正态曲线。
So as you can see over here, as we increase the sample size, the distribution of our data approaches a more normal curve.

8834
10:12:21,870 --> 10:12:22,272
好的。
Alright.

8835
10:12:22,432 --> 10:12:28,420
这基本上让我们能够使用仅依赖于正态分布的统计方法。
So this basically enables the use of statistical methods that rely only and only on normal distribution.

8836
10:12:28,912 --> 10:12:38,660
它将帮助我们利用样本数据对总体进行推断，并被用于假设检验、置信区间以及许多其他的推断。
It's going to help make inferences about the population using sample data, and it
is used in hypothesis testing, confidence intervals, and many more such inferences.

8837
10:12:38,832 --> 10:12:39,204
好的。
Alright.

8838
10:12:39,854 --> 10:12:44,356
基本例子是，假设你想测量一所学校学生的平均身高。
